msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:47
msgid ""
"**Warm Cream** (`#e9e5dd`): Button background — a warm, neutral cream "
"that avoids the coldness of pure gray"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:48
msgid ""
"**Parchment Border** (`#dcd7d3`): Card and divider borders — warm light "
"gray with slight pink undertone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:50
msgid "Neutrals & Text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:51
msgid ""
"**Charcoal Ink** (`#292827`): Primary heading and body text on white "
"surfaces"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:52
msgid "**Amethyst Link** (`#714cb6`): In-content links with underline decoration"
