#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:56
msgid "Semantic & Accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:57
msgid ""
"Superhuman operates with extreme color restraint — Lavender Glow "
"(`#cbb7fb`) is the only true accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:58
msgid ""
"Interactive states are communicated through opacity shifts and underline "
"decorations rather than color changes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:59
msgid ""
"The warm cream button palette avoids any saturated semantic colors (no "
"red errors, green success visible on marketing)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:61
msgid "Gradient System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:62
msgid ""
"**Hero Gradient**: Deep purple gradient starting from `#1b1938`, "
"transitioning through purple-to-twilight tones across the hero section — "
"the most dramatic visual element on the entire site"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:63
msgid ""
"**Content Transition**: The gradient dissolves into the white content "
"area, creating a cinematic curtain-lift effect as the user scrolls"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:64
msgid ""
"No other gradients on the marketing site — the hero gradient is a "
"singular dramatic gesture"
msgstr ""

