#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:95
msgid "Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:96
msgid ""
"**Non-standard weight axis**: Weights 460 and 540 are deliberately "
"between conventional Regular (400) and Medium (500), creating a "
"typographic texture that feels subtly \"off\" in a confident way — "
"slightly heavier than expected, never quite bold"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:97
msgid ""
"**Extreme display compression**: Display headlines at 0.96 line-height "
"collapse lines nearly on top of each other, creating dense typographic "
"blocks that feel architectural"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:98
msgid ""
"**Body generosity**: In contrast, body text at 1.50 line-height is "
"extremely spacious, ensuring comfortable reading after the dense headline"
" impact"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:99
msgid ""
"**Selective negative tracking**: Letter-spacing is applied surgically — "
"-1.32px on 48px headings, -0.63px on 28px features, but 0px on body text."
" The larger the text, the tighter the tracking"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:100
msgid ""
"**Variable font efficiency**: A single font file serves all weight "
"variations (460–700), enabling smooth weight transitions and micro-"
"adjustments"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:102
msgid "4. Component Stylings"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:104
msgid "Buttons"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:105
msgid ""
"**Warm Cream Primary**: `#e9e5dd` background, Charcoal Ink (`#292827`) "
"text, subtle rounded corners (8px radius), no visible border. The "
"signature CTA — warm, muted, luxurious rather than aggressive"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:106
msgid ""
"**Dark Primary** (on light sections): `#292827` background with white "
"text, 8px radius — inverse of the warm cream for contrast sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:107
msgid ""
"**Ghost / Text Link**: No background, underline decoration, Amethyst Link"
" (`#714cb6`) or Charcoal Ink color depending on context"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:108
msgid ""
"**Hero CTA**: Warm Cream on the dark purple gradient — the cream color "
"pops dramatically against `#1b1938`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:109
msgid ""
"**Hover**: Subtle opacity or brightness shift — no dramatic color "
"transformations"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:111
msgid "Cards & Containers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:112
msgid ""
"**Content Card**: White background, Parchment Border (`#dcd7d3`) 1px "
"border, 16px border-radius — clean and minimal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:113
msgid ""
"**Dark Surface Card**: `#292827` border on dark sections, maintaining "
"warm-neutral tone"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:114
msgid ""
"**Hero Surface**: Semi-transparent white border (`rgba(255, 255, 255, "
"0.2)`) on purple gradient — ghostly containment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:115
msgid ""
"**Product Screenshot Cards**: Large product UI images with clean edges, "
"minimal framing — the product itself is the visual"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:116
msgid ""
"**Hover**: Minimal state changes — consistency and calm over flashy "
"interactions"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:118
msgid "Inputs & Forms"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:119
msgid ""
"Minimal form presence on the marketing site — Superhuman funnels users "
"directly to signup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:120
msgid ""
"Dark-bordered inputs with Charcoal Ink borders and warm-toned placeholder"
" text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:121
msgid ""
"Focus: Border emphasis increase, likely shifting from Parchment Border to"
" Charcoal Ink"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:123
msgid "Navigation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:124
msgid ""
"**Top nav**: Clean white background on content sections, transparent on "
"hero gradient"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:125
msgid "**Nav links**: Super Sans VF at 16px, weight 460/600 for hierarchy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:126
msgid ""
"**CTA button**: Warm Cream (`#e9e5dd`) pill in the nav — subtle, not "
"attention-grabbing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:127
msgid ""
"**Sticky behavior**: Nav remains fixed on scroll with background "
"transition"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:128
msgid "**Mobile**: Collapses to hamburger menu with simplified layout"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:130
msgid "Image Treatment"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:131
msgid ""
"**Product screenshots**: Large, dominant product UI images showing the "
"email interface — the product is the hero"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:132
msgid ""
"**Lifestyle photography**: A single dramatic image (silhouette against "
"purple/red gradient) in the hero area — cinematic and editorial"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:133
msgid ""
"**Full-width presentation**: Screenshots span full container width with "
"subtle shadow or no border"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:134
msgid ""
"**Aspect ratios**: Wide landscape ratios (roughly 16:9) for product "
"screenshots"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:135
msgid ""
"**Color integration**: Screenshots are carefully color-graded to "
"harmonize with the purple-to-white page flow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:137
msgid "Testimonial / Social Proof"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:138
msgid "\"Your Superhuman suite\" section with product feature grid"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:139
msgid ""
"Feature descriptions paired with product screenshots — proof through "
"demonstration rather than quotes"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:140
msgid "Clean grid layout with consistent card sizing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:142
msgid "5. Layout Principles"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:144
msgid "Spacing System"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:145
msgid "**Base unit**: 8px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:146
msgid ""
"**Scale**: 2px, 4px, 6px, 8px, 12px, 16px, 18px, 20px, 24px, 28px, 32px, "
"36px, 40px, 48px, 56px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:147
msgid "**Section padding**: 48px–80px vertical between major sections"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:148
msgid "**Card padding**: 16px–32px internal spacing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:149
msgid "**Component gaps**: 8px–16px between related elements"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:151
msgid "Grid & Container"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:152
msgid "**Max width**: ~1200px content container, centered"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:153
msgid ""
"**Column patterns**: Full-width hero, centered single-column for key "
"messaging, 2-3 column grid for feature cards"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:154
msgid ""
"**Feature grid**: Even column distribution for \"Your Superhuman suite\" "
"product showcase"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:156
msgid "Whitespace Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:157
msgid ""
"**Confident emptiness**: Generous whitespace between sections signals "
"premium positioning — every element has room to breathe"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:158
msgid ""
"**Product as content**: Large product screenshots fill space that lesser "
"sites would fill with marketing copy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:159
msgid ""
"**Progressive density**: The hero is spacious and cinematic, content "
"sections become denser with feature grids, then opens up again for CTAs"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:161
msgid "Border Radius Scale"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:162
msgid ""
"**8px**: Buttons, inline elements (`span`, `button`, `div`) — the "
"universal small radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:163
msgid ""
"**16px**: Cards, links, larger containers (`a`, card elements) — the "
"universal large radius"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:164
msgid ""
"Only two radii in the entire system — radical simplicity. No micro-"
"rounding (2px), no pill shapes (50px+)"
msgstr ""

