#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:176
msgid "Shadow Philosophy"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:177
msgid ""
"Superhuman's elevation system is remarkably restrained on the marketing "
"site. Depth is primarily communicated through:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:178
msgid ""
"**Border containment**: Warm-toned borders (`#dcd7d3`) at 1px create "
"gentle separation"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:179
msgid ""
"**Color contrast**: The hero gradient creates massive depth through color"
" shift rather than shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:180
msgid ""
"**Product screenshots**: Screenshots themselves create depth by showing a"
" layered UI within the flat page"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:181
msgid ""
"**Opacity layering**: Semi-transparent whites on the hero gradient create"
" atmospheric depth layers"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:183
msgid "Decorative Depth"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:184
msgid ""
"**Hero gradient**: The `#1b1938` → white gradient transition is the "
"primary depth device — a cinematic curtain effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:185
msgid ""
"**Lavender accents**: `#cbb7fb` Lavender Glow elements float above the "
"dark gradient, creating a stellar/atmospheric effect"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:186
msgid ""
"**No glassmorphism**: Despite the translucent borders, there are no blur"
"/frosted-glass effects"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:187
msgid ""
"**Photography depth**: The hero silhouette image creates natural "
"atmospheric depth without artificial CSS"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:189
msgid "7. Do's and Don'ts"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:191
msgid "Do"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:192
msgid ""
"Use Super Sans VF at weight 460 as the default — it's slightly heavier "
"than regular, which is the brand's typographic signature"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:193
msgid ""
"Keep display headlines at 0.96 line-height — the compression is "
"intentional and powerful"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:194
msgid ""
"Use Warm Cream (`#e9e5dd`) for primary buttons — not white, not gray, "
"specifically warm cream"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:195
msgid ""
"Limit border-radius to 8px (small) and 16px (large) — the binary radius "
"system is deliberate"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:196
msgid ""
"Apply negative letter-spacing on headlines only (-0.63px to -1.32px) — "
"body text stays at 0px"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:197
msgid ""
"Use Lavender Glow (`#cbb7fb`) as the only accent color — it's the sole "
"color departure from the neutral palette"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:198
msgid ""
"Let product screenshots be the primary visual content — the UI sells "
"itself"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:199
msgid ""
"Maintain the dramatic hero gradient as a singular gesture — the rest of "
"the page is white"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:201
msgid "Don't"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:202
msgid ""
"Use conventional font weights (400, 500, 600) — Superhuman's 460 and 540 "
"are deliberately between standard stops"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:203
msgid ""
"Add bright or saturated CTA colors (blue, green, red) — buttons are "
"intentionally muted in Warm Cream or Charcoal"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:204
msgid ""
"Introduce additional accent colors beyond Lavender Glow — the palette is "
"deliberately restrained to one accent"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:205
msgid ""
"Apply shadows generously — depth comes from borders, color contrast, and "
"photography, not box-shadows"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:206
msgid ""
"Use tight line-height on body text — display is compressed (0.96) but "
"body is generous (1.50)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:207
msgid ""
"Add decorative elements, icons, or illustrations — Superhuman relies on "
"product UI and minimal typography"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:208
msgid "Create pill-shaped buttons — the system uses 8px radius, not rounded pills"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/templates_superhuman.md:209
msgid ""
"Use pure black (`#000000`) for text — Charcoal Ink (`#292827`) is warmer "
"and softer"
msgstr ""

